<h1>Welcome to <%= @course.title %>!</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>Congratulations! You have successfully enrolled in <strong><%= @course.title %></strong>.</p>

<p>Course Details:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Instructor: <%= @course.instructor.name %></li>
  <li>Duration: <%= @course.duration %> hours</li>
  <li>Total Lessons: <%= @course.lessons.count %></li>
</ul>

<p>You can start learning right away by visiting your course:</p>
<p><%= link_to "Go to Course", @course_url %></p>

<p>Happy learning!</p>
<p>The Learning Platform Team</p>